silm:instances_papers_16_one_integrated_growing_knowledge_graph_chapters_01_integration_as_colimit_of_colimits_sections_02_per_entity_subdiagrams_yoneda_hom_legs silm:hasExample "In 'PerEntitySubdiagramYonedaHomLegs', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the microchip-identifier source leg ell_id lifts to a typed in-probe of HouseholdKG; the integrated apex sees the microchip as the canonical identity-leg witness for Mittens.; also, the vet-record source leg ell_vet lifts to a typed in-probe of HouseholdKG; the integrated apex sees the SOAP note as a typed evidence probe of Mittens." .
